# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
# In-ports `orders` and `shortages`, out-ports `big` and `rest`.
Load orders.
Count the rows of shortages as missing.
Attach limits to the result.
Join that with shortages on item is shortages.item as matched.
Keep only the rows where amount is more than 1000.
Send that to output big.
Load orders as o.
Combine that with shortages.
Send the result to output rest.
